  "text": "FAMILY WORKSPACE\nCare\nCaregivers\nMessages\nRequest care\nMB\nMaria Bennett\nFamily\n← My care\nRequest #28\nGet help\nCare story\nA helping hand for Ellie — Many Applicants\n\nOne-time care\n·\nEleanor Bennett · Thu, Sep 10\n·\nRaleigh, NC\n\nOpen for applications\n1\nCare request\n2\nFind caregivers\n3\nReview applicants\n4\n4\nGet started\nChoose a caregiver first\nReview applicants\n\nCompare experience, review application notes, and choose who feels right.\n\nFind more caregivers\nAll\n4\nShortlisted\n1\nPast\n0\nFilter or sort caregivers\nStatus\nAll caregivers\nInterested\nShortlisted\nHired\nDeclined\nNot selected\nWithdrawn\nPast applications\nSort\nLatest first\nOldest first\nCare rate high-low\nCare rate low-high\nCertifications & training\nAny\n⌄\nRequired certifications & training\n\nChoose what the caregiver must currently have. Select more than one to require all of them.\n\nCPR\nFirst Aid\nBasic Life Support (BLS)\nCertified Nursing Assistant (CNA)\nHome Health Aide (HHA)\nPersonal Care Aide (PCA)\nMedication Aide or Technician\nDementia care training\nOther certification or training\n\n4 caregivers match the applicant filters\n\nSM\nSofia Martinez\nShortlisted\n\nRaleigh, NC\n\n7 years experience\n★ 4.9 · 24 reviews\nReliability 98%\nIdentity verified\nBackground check\nTop caregiver\n\n$30.00/hr care\n\n+ $1.00/hr processing · USD\n\nView profile\nHire Sofia\nStart chat\n\nApplication note\n\nI am available for your schedule and would love to help Ellie with her everyday routine.\n\nProfile details\n\nAccepting clients\n\nI enjoy helping older adults keep a familiar routine, prepare meals, and stay connected.\n\nSkills: Companionship, Meal preparation, Light housekeeping\n\nLanguages: English\n\nRate recorded on application: $30.00/hour. The care rate above reflects the pricing that applies to this request.\n\nApplication received Sep 7, 2026, 8:54 AM\n\nMore options for Sofia\nSave for later\nNot this caregiver\nJW\nJames Wilson\nInterested\n\nRaleigh, NC\n\n5 years experience\n★ 4.8 · 18 reviews\nReliability 98%\nIdentity verified\nBackground check\nTop caregiver\n\n$30.00/hr care\n\n+ $1.00/hr processing · USD\n\nView profile\nHire James\nShortlist & chat\n\nApplication note\n\nI am available for your schedule and would love to help Ellie with her everyday routine.\n\nProfile details\n\nAccepting clients\n\nPatient, dependable support with companionship, everyday tasks, and gentle encouragement.\n\nSkills: Companionship, Meal preparation, Light housekeeping\n\nLanguages: English\n\nRate recorded on application: $30.00/hour. The care rate above reflects the pricing that applies to this request.\n\nApplication received Sep 7, 2026, 8:54 AM\n\nMore options for James\nSave for later\nNot this caregiver\nAR\nAisha Robinson\nInterested\n\nRaleigh, NC\n\n9 years experience\n★ 5.0 · 31 reviews\nReliability 98%\nIdentity verified\nBackground check\nTop caregiver\n\n$30.00/hr care\n\n+ $1.00/hr processing · USD\n\nView profile\nHire Aisha\nShortlist & chat\n\nApplication note\n\nI am available for your schedule and would love to help Ellie with her everyday routine.\n\nProfile details\n\nAccepting clients\n\nI bring a calm approach to home support and take time to understand each person.\n\nSkills: Companionship, Meal preparation, Light housekeeping\n\nLanguages: English\n\nRate recorded on application: $30.00/hour. The care rate above reflects the pricing that applies to this request.\n\nApplication received Sep 7, 2026, 8:54 AM\n\nMore options for Aisha\nSave for later\nNot this caregiver\nOC\nOliver Chen\nInterested\n\nRaleigh, NC\n\n4 years experience\n★ 4.8 · 12 reviews\nReliability 98%\nIdentity verified\nBackground check\nTop caregiver\n\n$30.00/hr care\n\n+ $1.00/hr processing · USD\n\nView profile\nHire Oliver\nShortlist & chat\n\nApplication note\n\nI am available for your schedule and would love to help Ellie with her everyday routine.\n\nProfile details\n\nAccepting clients\n\nFriendly and dependable companionship, everyday meal preparation, and help around the home.\n\nSkills: Companionship, Meal preparation, Light housekeeping\n\nLanguages: English\n\nRate recorded on application: $30.00/hour. The care rate above reflects the pricing that applies to this request.\n\nApplication received Sep 7, 2026, 8:54 AM\n\nMore options for Oliver\nSave for later\nNot this caregiver\n\n© 2026 LoLo Care Inc\n\n﻿\nTerms of Service\nPrivacy Policy\nPayments & Cancellation\nCaregiver Terms\nFamily Terms\nSafety Policy\nAll Legal Documents",
